                <invention-title lang="de">SEQUENZIERUNG DER GÜLTIGKEIT VON ZUGANGSKONTROLLSCHLÜSSELN</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">SÉQUENÇAGE DE LA VALIDITÉ DE CLÉS DE CONTRÔLE D'ACCÈS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">SEQUENCING THE VALIDITY OF ACCESS CONTROL KEYS</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Mechanisms are provided to sequence one or more access control keys residing on a mobile device to be used with an access control reader. In particular, solutions are described which allow a mobile device to receive one or more access control keys and receive additional sequence data. The sequence data may be created for a particular route or course such that a user is require to present the received access control keys to an access control reader in a particular order to gain access to a protected asset.</p>
            </abstract>
